{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Please create a fully responsive product section with the following requirements:
    
    Global Typography Settings (Important)
    
    All text styles must use Barlow font family.
    
    The following properties must be configurable in the theme editor or section settings:
    
    Title (H2)
    Font family: Barlow
    Font size: adjustable (desktop + mobile separately)
    Font weight: adjustable (default 600 or 700)
    Line height: adjustable
    Text content: editable in CMS
    Subtitle
    Font family: Barlow
    Font size: adjustable (desktop + mobile separately)
    Font weight: adjustable (default 400 or 500)
    Line height: adjustable
    Text content: editable in CMS
    Section 1: Featured Adjustable Dumbbells
    
    Title: Featured Adjustable Dumbbells
    Subtitle: Find the perfect weight for your training goals.
    
    Product Carousel
    25LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    55LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    66LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    88LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    Layout Rules
    Desktop: max 4 products visible at once, horizontal scroll enabled
    Mobile: max 3 products visible at once, swipe enabled
    Section 2: Build Your Home Gym
    
    Title: Build Your Home Gym
    Subtitle: Everything you need for strength, cardio, and family fitness.
    
    Tab Component
    
    Tabs:
    
    Strength Training
    Cardio Training
    Kids Fun
    Tab Content (Carousel inside each tab)
    Strength Training
    Adjustable Weight Bench
    Dumbbell Stand
    Adjustable Kettlebell
    Cardio Training
    Foldable Exercise Bike
    Folding Exercise Bike with Resistance Bands
    Recumbent Exercise Bike
    Weighted Vest
    Battle Rope
    Kids Fun
    Fitness Trampoline
    Kids Trampoline
    Responsive Requirements
    Desktop
    Show up to 4 products per row
    Horizontal scroll when overflow
    Mobile
    Show up to 3 products per row
    Swipe to scroll horizontally
    UI Behavior Requirements
    Tabs switch instantly without page reload
    Each tab maintains its own carousel state if possible
    Active tab highlight required
    Consistent product card design across all categories
    Fully responsive (mobile / tablet / desktop)
    Goal
    
    This is a promotional campaign section designed to improve product discovery and cross-category purchasing across strength, cardio, and family fitness products., Each product card must include:
    
    Product image (primary focus)
    Product title (max 1–2 lines)
    Price
    quick add button
    Mobile Layout (Priority for Conversion)
    Display 2 full product cards + partial 3rd card visible
    Each product card width should be approximately 45%–48% of screen width
    This creates a visual cue that more content is available via swipe
    Mobile rules:
    Max visible fully: 2 items
    Third item should be partially visible (do not force 3 full cards)
    Horizontal swipe enabled
    Card height should remain compact and consistent (approx. 260–340px total height including image, title, and price)
