    }, Here is the completely translated and refined brief, optimized specifically for your developer (Gabriel). It maintains a professional, clear, and action-oriented tone that developers appreciate.💬 Copy and paste the text below to your developer:Hi Gabriel,Could you please help restructure the product carousel component on the homepage/landing page for mobile view, as well as upgrade its features? Based on the layout overlap issues we saw earlier (refer to 截屏2026-06-03 14.08.52.png), we want to transition to a 1.5-card peek carousel and add a discount badge.Please refer to the following specifications for the implementation:1. Change Mobile View to Display 1.5 Products (1.5-Card Carousel)Implementation: For mobile screens (max-width: 768px), please configure the Swiper/Slider slidesPerView to around 1.5 (or set the card width to roughly 60vw to 65vw). The partial card on the right must peek into the screen to naturally guide users to swipe horizontally.Fix Card Heights: Completely remove any fixed height from the product cards and change it to height: auto;. Use Flexbox layout (flex-direction: column;) and apply margin-top: auto; to the "Add to Cart" button so that all buttons automatically align perfectly at the bottom of the cards.2. Adjust Mobile Title Font Size to 12pxImplementation:Desktop: Keep the current style as is.Mobile: Change the title font size to 12px with a line-height: 1.4;.Truncation Rule: Please implement -webkit-line-clamp: 2; so that titles can show up to 2 lines on mobile before truncating with an ellipsis. This ensures we show crucial product keywords (e.g., "Anchor Bench") rather than cutting off too early like the current "Anchor...".3. Add a Discount BadgePlacement: Positioned at the top-left corner of the product card (required for both desktop and mobile views).Content: Display the percentage saved based on the original price and the marked-down sale price, formatted as xx% OFF.Calculation Logic: If a product has a compare_at_price (original price) that is greater than the current sale price, automatically calculate: $\text{Discount} = \left(1 - \frac{\text{Sale Price}}{\text{Regular Price}}\right) \times 100\%$., change desktop product images' aspect ratio to 80%, every tabs should have 4 products
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.tab_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.tabs_margin_bottom }}px;
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.tab_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tab_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.tab_font_weight }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.tab_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.tab_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.tab_active_border_width }}px solid transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    bottom: -{{ block.settings.tab_border_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
    border-bottom-color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_border_color }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.tab_active_font_weight }};
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.product_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 4px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_background }};
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_margin_top }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-progress-fill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_color }};
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: width 0.1s ease;
    width: 0%;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.products_per_row_desktop | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.product_gap }}px)) / {{ block.settings.products_per_row_desktop }});
    min-width: calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.products_per_row_desktop | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.product_gap }}px)) / {{ block.settings.products_per_row_desktop }});
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-{{ block.settings.card_hover_lift }}px);
    box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_hover_shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.card_hover_shadow_blur }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_hover_shadow_opacity }});
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-discount-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.badge_font_weight }};
    z-index: 2;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.product_title_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.product_title_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.product_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.product_title_margin_bottom }}px;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_price_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.product_price_font_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.product_price_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.product_price_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_price_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-product-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 {{ block.settings.mobile_container_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.mobile_card_width_percent }}%;
      min-width: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_width_percent }}%;
      height: auto;
      justify-content: space-between;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_aspect_ratio }}%;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 12px 12px 16px 12px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.tab_gap | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.tab_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.tab_padding_vertical | times: 0.8 }}px {{ block.settings.tab_padding_horizontal | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
      min-height: 36px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 10px 0;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-discount-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      top: 8px;
      left: 8px;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
          display: block;
        }
      }

      .ai-product-promo-variant-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #666666;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      appearance: none;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      line-height: normal;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
      background-color: #cccccc;
      color: #ffffff;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-loading {
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.75;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
      .ai-product-promo-variant-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        font-size: 11px;
      }
    }
{% endstyle %}

<product-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-product-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    
    {% if block.settings.section_1_enabled %}
    <div class="ai-product-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-product-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.section_1_title != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-product-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_1_title }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.section_1_subtitle != blank %}
          <p class="ai-product-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_1_subtitle }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-product-promo-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-product-promo-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-promo-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-carousel="section-1">
            {% assign product_prefix = 'section_1_product_' %}

              {% for i in (1..4) %}
                {% assign product_key = product_prefix | append: i %}
                {% assign variant_id_key = product_prefix | append: i | append: '_variant_id' %}
                {% assign product = block.settings[product_key] %}
                {% assign selected_variant_id = block.settings[variant_id_key] | strip %}

                {% if product != blank %}
                  {% assign display_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}

                  {% if selected_variant_id != blank %}
                    {% assign selected_variant_id_number = selected_variant_id | times: 1 %}
                    {% for variant in product.variants %}
                      {% if variant.id == selected_variant_id_number %}
                        {% assign display_variant = variant %}
                        {% break %}
                      {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                  {% endif %}

                  {% assign display_image = display_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_image %}
                  {% assign product_url = product.url | append: '?variant=' | append: display_variant.id %}

                  <div class="ai-product-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <a href="{{ product_url }}" class="ai-product-promo-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {% if display_variant.compare_at_price > display_variant.price %}
                        {% assign discount_amount = display_variant.compare_at_price | minus: display_variant.price %}
                        {% assign discount_percent = discount_amount | times: 100.0 | divided_by: display_variant.compare_at_price | round %}
                        <div class="ai-product-promo-discount-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          {{ discount_percent }}% OFF
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}

                      {% if display_image %}
                        <img
                          src="{{ display_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                          alt="{{ display_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                          class="ai-product-promo-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                          loading="lazy"
                          width="600"
                          height="600"
                        >
                      {% else %}
                        <div class="ai-product-promo-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}
                    </a>

                    <div class="ai-product-promo-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      <h3 class="ai-product-promo-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                        <a href="{{ product_url }}" class="ai-product-promo-product-title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          {{ product.title }}
                          {% unless display_variant.title == 'Default Title' %}
                            <span class="ai-product-promo-variant-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                              {{ display_variant.title }}
                            </span>
                          {% endunless %}
                        </a>
                      </h3>

                      <div class="ai-product-promo-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                        {{ display_variant.price | money }}
                        {% if display_variant.compare_at_price > display_variant.price %}
                          <span class="ai-product-promo-product-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                            {{ display_variant.compare_at_price | money }}
                          </span>
                        {% endif %}
                      </div>

                      <button
                        type="button"
                        class="ai-product-promo-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                        data-variant-id="{{ display_variant.id }}"
                        {% unless display_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
                      >
                        {% if display_variant.available %}
                          View More
                        {% else %}
                          Sold Out
                        {% endif %}
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-product-promo-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-promo-progress-fill-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-progress="section-1"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.section_2_enabled %}
    <div class="ai-product-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
